<section id="voice">
    <h2>Voice & Language</h2>
    

    <h3>Plain Language Guidelines</h3>
    <p>The target reading level is for adults, but really anyone who can get into the kitchen and cook! We keep our langauge casual, and approachable, so anyone can feel like they can use our recipes. We avoid overly dense and complex language and sentence structure, as to not turn people away from our recipes.</p>

